{"id":"n30184-1-15","stage":1,"title":"작년 · 去年","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30184-1-15-1","ko":"저는 작년에 한국에 왔어요.","zh":"我去年来到韩国的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작년에","meaning":"去年","explanation":"작년：去年；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"작년","audio":"/audio/201b780a33a41d77aa74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30184","senseId":"1","lemma":"작년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한국에","meaning":"韩国","explanation":"한국：韩国；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"한국에","audio":"/audio/0668fd72ac3d24742754.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"왔어요.","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"201b780a33a41d77","term":"작년","zh":"去年","audio":"/audio/201b780a33a41d77aa74.mp3","entryId":"30184","definition":"正经历的年份的前面一年。","pronunciation":["장년"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe75fdcc19e0a7084ffc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30184-1-15-2","ko":"그래요? 그럼 한국에 온 지 일 년 되셨군요.","zh":"是吗？那您来韩国已经一年了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래요?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한국에","meaning":"韩国","explanation":"한국：韩国；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"한국에","audio":"/audio/0668fd72ac3d24742754.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"온","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지","meaning":"从那时起，从那以后","explanation":"지：从那时起，从那以后","readings":[{"term":"지","audio":"/audio/32e608b594bece7ab3a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91881","senseId":"1","lemma":"지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"一","explanation":"일：一","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31528","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"년","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되셨군요.","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"32e608b594bece7a","term":"지","zh":"从那时起，从那以后","audio":"/audio/32e608b594bece7ab3a3.mp3","entryId":"91881","definition":"表示从某事发生到现在。","pronunciation":["지"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"31528","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["일"]},{"id":"e23df8834a583975","term":"년","zh":"年","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3","entryId":"26823","definition":"计算年度的数量单位。","pronunciation":["년"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/da32906afda41c42f31e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.693,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=30184","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.1731,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？那您来韩国已经一年了啊。","大家，今天是爸爸的生日，所以我们打算晚上去外面吃饭。","我去年来到韩国的。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是吗？那您来韩国已经一年了啊。","我去年来到韩国的。","大家，今天是爸爸的生日，所以我们打算晚上去外面吃饭。"],"answer":0}]}
